 ## 1. OVERVIEW
 
 <!-- HVR_REFERENCE: .skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-with-human-voice/references/hvr-rules.md -->
 
+### Purpose
+
+Defines the CLI command, argument, output and failure contract callers may rely on.
+
